{"schemaVersion":"galpedia-static-detail-model-v1","dataRevision":"a0c0367b8270b080feef0ef1fe65522144dc62343feb9d752729d92867d0d639","workId":"23314","model":{"presentationWorkId":"vndb:v52158","staff":{"artwork":[{"creditedName":"杜若 つくね","creatorId":"vndb:s6642","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s6642","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s6642","name":"杜若 つくね","roleCode":"art","roleLabel":"原画","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:209485","source":"vndb"}],"scenario":[{"creditedName":"ますだのぶあつ","creatorId":"vndb:s16706","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s16706","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s16706","name":"ますだのぶあつ","roleCode":"scenario","roleLabel":"剧本","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:209486","source":"vndb"}],"music":[],"other":[]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_vndb_c140768","characterName":"石戸 霞","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c140768"},"originalCharacterName":"石戸 霞","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"716"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"164"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Kasumi is a third-year at Eisui Girls' High School in Kagoshima Prefecture and Komaki's closest blood-relative, her cousin. She and the other members of Eisui's team are shrine maidens; she belongs to a branch family of the maidens' lineage. Kasumi is also the president of the school's mahjong club. Kasumi is a very kind and polite girl. She is close with the rest of her team, especially Komaki, whom she calls \"Komaki-chan\" rather than \"Princess\"."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Kasumi's abilities stem from her close relationship with Komaki. Since she couldn't be the vessel for all nine of her goddess spirits, Kasumi, being her closest blood relative, had to be the vessel for one of them, which happens to be an evil goddess. With the goddess spirit, Kasumi can randomly collect one type of suit for each round. However she can not switch back to her usual style until she is purified."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c140768"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/45/45cf911e6e084462e1097b02600f8e6d81fad35d792b283eafa3fb2a2bb797f1.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/17/17efdac49251306f771c49b9fc7cf3eefad7cde77288164e70a734f67924889f.webp","width":161,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"犬飼 あお","creatorId":"vndb:s942","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s942","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s942","name":"犬飼 あお","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:98605","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c140769","characterName":"神代 小蒔","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c140769"},"originalCharacterName":"神代 小蒔","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"308"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"154"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Komaki is a second-year at Eisui Girls' High School in Kagoshima Prefecture. She and the other members of Eisui's team are shrine maidens; she belongs to the primary branch family of the maidens' lineage and is affectionately called \"Princess\" by the others. A year prior to the events of the story she had achieved fame as one of the new monsters of the nationals, but pushed herself too hard. Komaki is a kind girl who respects her opponents and tries to give her all in return. She is also loved and respected by all of her teammates."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"While awake, Komaki is just a normal girl who tries to do her best but isn't very good. Her true power is shown when she sleeps during matches. At this point she is possessed by one of the 8 goddess spirits that inhabit her. What ability she gains is dependent on which spirit possesses her. She cannot control which one descends; the stronger her opponents, the stronger the spirit."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c140769"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/01/01b742c116d8c7c99d28f1c09aa03e521d23a393c2bdb7f6151ffcc149a13b99.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/bf/bfdb54b4020a9a5ed758a3624ba809e581296e4940968e80e217a4825f2837e9.webp","width":184,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"貴坂 理緒","creatorId":"vndb:s946","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s946","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s946","name":"貴坂 理緒","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:98606","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c140770","characterName":"滝見 春","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c140770"},"originalCharacterName":"滝見 春","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"418"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Haru is a first-year at Eisui Girls' High School and a member of its mahjong team."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c140770"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0b/0b5079132e4891da57ef9295a6efcac781346cbbdb48492eb369209cd37a02ae.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/70/709d84509198c14844ef56262af8befc483cfea00ac5f2a4396587ee590fe4d1.webp","width":125,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"秋山 はるる","creatorId":"vndb:s339","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s339","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s339","name":"椎那 天","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:98608","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c140771","characterName":"薄墨 初美","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c140771"},"originalCharacterName":"薄墨 初美","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"528"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Hatsumi is a third-year at Eisui Girls' High School in Kagoshima Prefecture. She and the other members of Eisui's team are shrine maidens; she belongs to a branch family of the maidens' lineage. When it's her turn to play, she comes out in a ceremonial headdress and puts it back on afterwards. Hatsumi is quite energetic, but can be quite stubborn, still believing that she can make a hand while in the north seat after she was repeatedly blocked by Sae Usuzawa and warned by her teammates. She seems to care a lot about Komaki's well being as she doesn't want Komaki to overexert herself. Hatsumi loves to swim."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c140771"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/77/77cdddc62a0c6c2d29a9f2521a712dab0478abb0deda54047c15a853cd657bae.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/70/7021a9549231e802d93e2a2558c4b86c3bcea94353e3a5d4760a41fc0a1f0a95.webp","width":256,"height":250,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"大山 チロル","creatorId":"vndb:s996","sourceP